{"id":"wb-5-266","name":"崔府君庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"崔府君庙","text":"崔府君庙是位于中华人民共和国山西省晋城市陵川县礼义镇北街村的一座祠庙，供奉崔府君，又称显应王庙，2001年被列为第五批全国重点文物保护单位，是现存的崔府君庙中规模最大的一座。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B4%94%E5%BA%9C%E5%90%9B%E5%BA%99","revisionId":94711325,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94711325","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/1e415f10ddbeb6da8bb0f37b.jpg","title":"20260814_Cui_Fujun_Temple_02.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20260814_Cui_Fujun_Temple_02.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f0/20260814_Cui_Fujun_Temple_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​全国重点文物保护单位 山西陵川 崔府君庙","width":320,"height":213}}